      "text": "The GPS trace (EV-GPS-02736) is impaired with weight_multiplier 0.85 due to a 60-second sampling gap (issue code GPS_GAP_SHORT_OR_OUTSIDE_WINDOW). Under POL-GEN-02(1), this impairment must be disclosed and reduces the weight of the trace. This affects the evidence for the driver's arrival and dwell.",
